US-045 complete and committed (`e07e381`). Implemented the ParametricExplorer widget end-to-end: Zod schema with discriminated param shapes (slider/select/toggle); React widget that debounces (150ms default) and renders matplotlib PNG and/or `result` JSON value; editor with per-type param inputs and CodeMirror Python panes for setupCode/renderCode; new `runWithPlotParam` worker message with lazy matplotlib install and per-setupCode namespace caching; CSS tokens, registry entry, and SectionSchema variant wired. Verified in playwright headless: a sin-frequency slider redrew the plot after debounce, and a value-mode squared-x slider updated 9 → 25.
